From 5b61a096ec7e070f5b14b32f29f0f4e599ae3824 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Canepa <l.canepa@aequitax.pro>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 13:49:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mitgliedschaft): the volleyball table names only the
 total fee

The "Davon Lizenz" column (added in d71f8e8's sibling fix to show the
licence's share) put two amounts side by side, and a reader could not tell
whether the licence comes on top of the fee. It is included; the table now
shows only the amount the invoice carries. The Swiss Volley licence fees
keep their own table directly beneath, and the note that the licence is
part of the membership fee stays.

With two columns the volleyball table lays out like basketball's, so the
stacked phone layout from bfd06d4 and its in-cell labels go; the tighter
phone cells stay. The asterisk footnote and both i18n keys had no other
user and go with the column.

Changelog 1.28.2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LjCj51XTjsHKhsGrPq2C5h
